-- ============================================================================
-- All configurable values are loaded from (in order):
--   1) Tiled properties (per-object overrides)
--   2) Project > Game Settings... runtime settings
--   3) developer/config/game_config.lua (project defaults)
-- Do not hardcode values here - add them to config instead.
-- ============================================================================

